{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Gets a Job at a Magazine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Night Before"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le16ob04re1img01.png"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The oy and the oi sound"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "The oy or oi sound in a word is called a dipthong.  A dipthong is two vowel sounds in one syllable.<br/><br/>The dipthong oi and oy make the \u201coy\u201d sound as in <span class=\"strong\">boy</span>.<br/><br/>See the chart below for examples.  Read the words aloud."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"OY\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"OI\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"boy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"boil\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enjoy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"voice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"employ\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"noise\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"annoy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"coin\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"destroy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"join\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I was invited to join the magazine publication last week. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Did I make the right choice?  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I find a lot of joy when I share my experiences with others. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stability"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the quality or state of being stable or permanent"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I would be nice to have some work stability."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob04aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in a blog about jobs and work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be a voice"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to represent a group of people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I want to be the voice of my generation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "determination"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a quality that makes you continue trying to do or achieve something that is difficult "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: With a lot of determination, you can be successful."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to come in handy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "turn out to be useful "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My experience as an online blogger should come in handy."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "age group"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a number of people or things grouped  together by age."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to write for a certain age group."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "officially"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a formal manner or way "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I am officially employed as Cambridge's newest freelancer. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "salaried"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "paid to a person on a regular basis "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  A permanent job is a salaried position."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob04aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research freelance jobs online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of 5 different freelance jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose 3 freelance jobs you would like to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down notes on why you chose these three jobs. Example: The name of job and job description."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present the three jobs and your reasons to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research freelance jobs online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write down notes on three freelance jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present three jobs to a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le16ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le16ob04re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le16ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "I have some exciting news! I am officially employed as Cambridge's newest freelancer.<br/>I was invited to join the magazine publication last week. This is a fantastic opportunity for me to prove myself as a serious writer. Honestly, I'm nervous.  This is a big change from sharing my experience online.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le16ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Freelance writing is not a permanent, salaried position. Hopefully, they will recognize my hard work 